# Cline Rules - Auto-approve safe read-only commands
# File ini mengizinkan auto-approve untuk command pembacaan aman

## Auto-approve commands (read-only, safe)
# File and directory listing
ls
find
pwd

# File reading
cat
head
tail
less
more

# Search and filter
grep
rg (ripgrep)
wc
sort
uniq
diff

# Node.js (read-only operations)
node --version
npm --version
npm list
npm outdated
npm audit

# Git (read-only operations)
git status
git log
git diff
git branch
git remote
git show

# System info
which
echo
uname
date
whoami

# File information
file
stat
du
df
tree
